# Contributing to ollama-podman-openwebui-fedora-kde-guide

Thank you for taking the time to contribute. This guide exists to help engineers get a reliable, GPU-accelerated local LLM environment running on Fedora 44 KDE Plasma as quickly as possible. Every correction, clarification, and improvement makes that goal easier to achieve for the next person.

---

## Table of Contents

- [Ways to Contribute](#ways-to-contribute)
